{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_08_end","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_08","title":"激戰之末","storyCode":"MB-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"3fb4a2d130a6e3bddb1a9a3d4b37401e6aa577bf3d540f1588d3d0e527aff1cd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在傑斯頓的萬全準備下，安東尼逐漸不敵，眼看越獄就要失敗，塞雷婭及時趕到。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混帳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的，安東尼老弟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓小姐，沒想到你的戰鬥能力也相當出色，我越來越喜歡你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，現在幫助我的話，我依然可以原諒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙的手到底是怎麼回事，變黑之後變得好硬的樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微為你介紹一下吧，我的源石技藝能力呢，是操控鐵元素，而我的身體，接受過一些小小的改造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才的攻擊是不是感覺打到了鐵板上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"那不只是我的源石技藝的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我的皮膚下層，有著萊茵生命科技的結晶——一些小小的金屬板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我並不清楚這東西的學名是什麼，總之它能夠大幅減少你進攻的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是萊茵生命的人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不，很遺憾，我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，即使被抑制器限制，依然如此善戰，真是令人吃驚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我也得拿出一些真本事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"他的手，變成了刀刃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"從我來到這座監獄後，第一眼看到你的時候開始，我就感到了一種不協調。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你盡力在克制著自己，讓自己顯得無害，讓自己顯得有禮貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你的存在本身就是力量的彰顯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"從那時起，我就很期待現在這一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你撕開溫文爾雅的偽裝後，凶性畢露的樣貌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"想必我沒有令你失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我大開眼界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":true,"text":"你沒有資格判斷我的本性！！！吼！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":true,"text":"我也無意於這麼做。我只是想說，現在的你，看著順眼多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"連牙齒都用上了嗎，嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，你的牙齒是撕不開我的表皮的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惡，可惡啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，其實，安東尼老弟，你出去又能做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你救得了你的父母？挽回得了你的家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我告訴你，出去之後，你將一無所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明在這座監獄裡過得很好，甚至連典獄長都要禮讓你三分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我剛才說我早就可以下手，但其實沒有那麼輕鬆，如果你不打算越獄，我想要解決你也需要付出不小的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"何必呢，就這麼留在這座監獄裡過你的日子不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......六年前的7月24日，我正打算去參加一場晚宴，保鏢忽然告訴我，家裡出事了，父親讓我逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道發生了什麼事，甚至沒有見到父親母親一面，就踏上了逃亡的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"在逃到鑄鐵城後，我還是被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時以為到此為止了，但在進入這座監獄後沒多久，我就發現，或許不是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡得到了一個囚犯本不應有的優待，我馬上意識到了，我的入獄，恐怕也是我父親安排好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"真巧，我也是這麼認為的。既然你也這麼想，那就更不應該辜負你父親的意願了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我父親的意願？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......你似乎很喜歡站在高處為別人設計想法和路線，傑斯頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有人告訴過你，你很小器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"......曾經有人對我說過類似的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕，我的器量大小與否，與你能否完成越獄無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以在這裡生活得很舒服，甚至能夠將這裡改造成屬於我的王國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但這又怎麼樣呢？我只不過是一個最自由的囚犯罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡生活了六年，這六年裡，我無時不刻想要出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要出去，不是為了證明我有多了不起，而是我要搞清楚究竟發生了什麼，我要告訴那些讓我家破人亡的人，我們還沒完！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，你這番慷慨激昂的發言讓我開始有些討厭你了，安東尼老弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不過算了，無論如何，你也出不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我暫時無法打敗你，我也已經拖延了足夠久的時間，其他警衛應該也要解除封鎖趕過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你做得很好，你的同伴們也做得很好，這並不是你的過錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"只是這片大地上就是有那麼多不盡人意的事情發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，你的越獄到此為止了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"聽，死神來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"到此為止了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，怎麼辦怎麼辦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，死神暫時不會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，安東尼，你的聲音太大了，我在走道裡都聽到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說，你們的計畫連我都感到有些出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"花了一些時間才幫你們堵住了其他那些警衛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我好像見過你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵生命，防衛科主任，塞雷婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"我也記得你，傑斯頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到您這樣的大人物居然還記得我，真是榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"能來到我手上的簡歷並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也始終記得被您親口告知不合格的那一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"但首先，我很好奇，堂堂防衛科主任怎麼會出現在這樣一所監獄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"這點不用你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要知道，你該退場了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"......退場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，你似乎搞錯了什麼，塞雷婭主任，不，塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽聞你的能力與我有幾分相似，但還沒有與你交過手，就被你拒之門外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，我都對於你是否真的強過我，抱有一絲小小的疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，機會來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她手的顏色也變了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好白，好漂亮......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技藝確實與我有幾分相似之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_10"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉悶的碰撞聲在停屍間中不斷響起。\n在傑斯頓雙手凝結的黑色凶刃面前，塞雷婭的手刀看起來是如此無力。\n然而，事實卻並非如此。\n一步。\n兩步。\n三步。\n每一次碰撞，傑斯頓都不得不後退幾步。\n而塞雷婭的手刀上，甚至沒有出現一道裂痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我應當告訴過你，傑斯頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你太過安於現狀且沒有堅持，我的手下不需要這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的器量，太小了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——隨著塞雷婭的一記橫斬，傑斯頓的雙刃上出現了一道裂痕。\n一下。\n兩下。\n三下。\n傑斯頓甚至沒有進攻的空間，而只能防守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要你還是現在這樣毫無堅持的浮萍，來多少次我都會拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閃開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_10_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，閃開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塞雷婭的最後一劈，斬斷了傑斯頓的劍刃，在他身上劃下了一道細長卻又能見血肉的傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞......雷，婭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"太、太強了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然以前也聽說過防衛科的主任很厲害，但這也太猛了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我沒惹過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，塞......塞雷婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，還能動的話，繼續動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在那之前，我有一個問題要問你，安東尼•西蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"請問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有聽說過，斐爾迪南這個名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南......我從父親那裡聽說過這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南，果然是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安東尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["羅賓"]}]}
